{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o074b","title":"王昶任骠骑将军","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o074b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"王昶任骠骑将军","evidence":["shaodi-e-o074b-q"]},{"id":"xuhuwang-a-54942839d9f286f9bf35","label":"正文","text":"王昶功封二子进位骠骑","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-cfa2e2da3e732ed56e61"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0032","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o074b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":255,"label":"甲戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y255","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o072","basis":"甲戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o074b-q","shaodi-q-o072","shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o074b-q","source_order":[4,335,"O074b"],"order":1150}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0032","name":"王昶","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o074b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-c2120fe3d78208508cfc","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月甲寅〖22〗，封后父卞隆为列侯〖23〗。甲戌〖24〗，以征南大将军王昶为骠骑将军。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗二年：正元二年（公元 255）。乙丑：旧历十二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-96103ace1e11ae4131ba","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"shaodi-q-o072","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4b9070779d1c209c6814","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月，乙丑〖6〗，镇东将军毌丘俭、扬州刺史文钦反。（戊戌）〔戊寅〕〖7〗，大将军司马景王征之。癸未〖8〗，车骑将军郭淮薨。闰月，己亥〖9〗，破钦于乐嘉〖10〗；钦遁走，遂奔吴。甲辰〖11〗，安风淮津都尉斩俭〖12〗，传首京都。﹝一﹞壬子〖13〗，复特赦淮南士民诸为俭、钦所诖误者〖14〗。以镇南将军诸葛诞为镇东大将军〖15〗。司马景王薨于许昌。二月，丁巳〖16〗，以卫将军司马文王为大将军〖17〗，录尚书事。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":207},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-cfa2e2da3e732ed56e61","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-7c981ec9bc8033f22d73","layer":"original","quote":"封二子亭侯、关内侯，进位骠骑将军。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":35}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
